---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { offer, support, passes, passLengthNote } from '../../data/payment';
---

<Base
  title="Support"
  description="Get help with your Rsquared Academy account, access, payments and lessons."
>
  <section class="sec page-head" aria-labelledby="support-h">
    <div class="wrap legal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Support</span>
      <h1 id="support-h" class="t-h1">Support</h1>
      <p class="t-lead">Email <a href={`mailto:${support.email}`}>{support.email}</a>. Every message is read by a person, and we reply within {support.responseTime} (Monday to Friday, India Standard Time).</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec flush" aria-labelledby="include-h">
    <div class="wrap legal">
      <h2 id="include-h" class="t-h3">Please include</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The email address on your account.</li>
        <li>What you were doing and what happened. A screenshot helps.</li>
        <li>For payment questions, the order date and the payment id.</li>
        <li>For lesson or editor problems, your browser and operating system.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="t-h3">Common problems</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>I can't sign in.</strong> Accounts open with the paid courses. If a sign-in email doesn't arrive within 15 minutes, check spam, then write to us.</li>
        <li><strong>I paid but my course is locked.</strong> Access normally starts within a few minutes of payment. If it is not active after 30 minutes, email us with your receipt. See <a href="/delivery/">Delivery and access</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Which pass can I buy?</strong> The {passes.annual.exact} is our main plan. The {passes.monthly.exact} gives the same access to all paid tracks for {passes.monthly.days} days. Both are prepaid, one-time payments with no automatic renewal, available through Razorpay in India and our merchant of record outside India. {passLengthNote}</li>
        <li><strong>Can I buy again before my pass ends?</strong> Yes. The new period starts after your current end date, so no days are lost. There is no upgrade credit.</li>
        <li><strong>Do founding members keep their price?</strong> The founding offer is for the {passes.annual.exact} only, limited to {offer.foundingSeats} seats. You keep your founding price for each 12-month renewal bought before your pass ends or within {offer.renewalWindowDays} days after it ends. After a longer gap, the list price applies.</li>
        <li><strong>Will you remind me?</strong> We email before your pass ends: 30 and 7 days before for a {passes.annual.exact}; 5 and 1 days before for a {passes.monthly.exact}.</li>
        <li><strong>My access has ended.</strong> You can buy either pass again. Your progress is kept. Free courses stay free, and lessons 0–2 of every course stay free to try.</li>
        <li><strong>The code editor does not run.</strong> The editor runs R in your browser. Use a current version of Chrome, Edge, Firefox or Safari, and let the page finish loading the first time.</li>
        <li><strong>I want a refund.</strong> For a {passes.annual.exact}, you can ask within 14 days of purchase if you have completed less than 20% of the lessons in every paid track (no single track at 20% or more). The {passes.monthly.exact} has no refunds, except a duplicate charge or a technical problem we can't fix. Try lessons 0–2 of every course free before you buy. See the <a href="/refund/">Refund and cancellation policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>I want my data deleted.</strong> Email us with "Privacy" in the subject line. See the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a> page.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="t-h3">More help</h2>
      <p>For contact details and the postal address, see the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding-top: 96px;
    padding-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .legal {
    max-width: var(--text-max);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .legal ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 24px;
    list-style: disc;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .flush {
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .page-head {
      padding-block: var(--space-12);
    }
  }
</style>
